The product: Petrochemical Smart Operations Dashboard
Plant-wide smart operations dashboard: unit KPIs, utilities and safety analyt=
ics for petrochemical complexes.

Our match review points to Petrochemical Smart Operations Dashboard as the st=
rongest overlap with your focus: Petrochemical smart operations fits intellig=
ent manufacturing and industrial AI. Provisional focus fit, not investment re=
adiness or eligibility confirmation.

Maturity: validated prototype (TRL 4-5); the first real-data pilot on a partn=
er site is the agreed next milestone, and we would value exactly this convers=
ation with you.

A professional pitch deck is attached (inno-Abadan-Petrochemical-Smart-Dash.p=
ptx) - it contains the technical summary, the validation evidence with the ex=
act datasets and measured results, and cited market data. If you prefer a wal=
kthrough, we are glad to give a short online presentation at your convenience.

To be transparent about our stage: we are pre-commercial, seeking pilot partn=
ers and seed-stage funding, and we deliberately present each product to a sin=
gle investor whose focus overlaps the most. Would you be open to a 20-minute =
online call in the coming weeks?

